{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-20T04:53:45.257Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"f719b3080f29d4118076bddd","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1756","claim:pm-gh1757","claim:pm-gh1759","lineage:pm-gh1757","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1756+pm-gh1757+pm-gh1759","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1756","claim:pm-gh1757","claim:pm-gh1759","lineage:pm-gh1757","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.329","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-20T04:53:45.257Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-20T04:53:45.257Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Root cause has two halves. (1) redactGuidanceCredentials always led with the restore step whenever anything was redacted or the invocation carried credentials, with no notion of the credentials being the refusal's cause. (2) For PM_AUTHOR the command line carries no credential, yet the step still appeared: the identity refusal's own requirement text held a credential-shaped sample (user:password@), which the text rule rewrote to user:[redacted]@, so the pass reported a removal. Fix: the identity refusal declares url_credentials_rejected (a typed PmCliErrorContext marker, not a message heuristic), and the redactor then leads with a step that says not to restore them and to replay without URL credentials; the requirement text no longer contains a credential-shaped sample, so a PM_AUTHOR refusal carries only 'Rerun with PM_AUTHOR set to a plain name.' Verified through dist for --author JSON and text, PM_AUTHOR JSON, and the successful plain replay."}]}],"before_hash":"a3ff0abd45e7e7e8c6fd0d90e9b9cf2f3c615ce02f1616f6fc81da35e5024677","after_hash":"6ecee10f64032a64667c165795ad18e0690ac66037d0e1afa9e41923f4747536","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"305d2c1660720a2dba1b5acfccbbb2ba316a909eeafddf590dac7358d991991f"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-20T04:55:13.398Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"f719b3080f29d4118076bddd","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1756","claim:pm-gh1757","claim:pm-gh1759","lineage:pm-gh1757","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1756+pm-gh1757+pm-gh1759","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1756","claim:pm-gh1757","claim:pm-gh1759","lineage:pm-gh1757","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.329","source":"probe"}},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-20T04:55:13.398Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/contract_change","value":{"api":"PmCliErrorContext.url_credentials_rejected and identity refusal next_steps","before":"A refusal of an identity carrying URL userinfo (--author, PM_AUTHOR, --assignee and other identity options) led its next_steps with restoring the redacted credentials, and its requirement text held a credential-shaped sample that redaction rewrote","after":"Such refusals set url_credentials_rejected; their first next step says the credentials caused the refusal and must not be restored, and a PM_AUTHOR refusal, whose command line carries no credential, carries only the plain-name step","migrate":"Agents and clients matching the old restore-them step text for identity refusals should follow the plain-name step; producers whose refusal rejects URL credentials themselves set url_credentials_rejected: true on the PmCliError context"}}],"before_hash":"6ecee10f64032a64667c165795ad18e0690ac66037d0e1afa9e41923f4747536","after_hash":"5e30d194b5a35f155338218f84c8620310cf77f1b3353da17cb5718b09bef72